    "name": "Uprising on Altyyr 5",
    "steam_appid": 3536470,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536470/extras/766af73b4e47c4d00563d457fdc78da1.poster.avif?t=1750086767\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536470/extras/766af73b4e47c4d00563d457fdc78da1.webm?t=1750086767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536470/extras/766af73b4e47c4d00563d457fdc78da1.mp4?t=1750086767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uprising on Altyyr 5 is a top-down shooter with puzzle elements set in a facility on the 5th moon of the planet Altyyr which is run by The Domain, an insectoid race long thought extinct by the Unified Local Cluster Federation. What they are doing and why they are there is for Captain Rijk and his team to investigate whilst trying to escape and report back to ULCF High Command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* 7 Levels filled with puzzles and various enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* 12 different weapons to find and unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* An in depth storyline as you seek to escape the clutches of The Domain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Explore various levels with unique elements to each as well as the ability to fly a ship and drive a moon buggy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Use different objects to progress through each level like air locks, pressure switches, hidden doors and switches, teleporters and the functions of various weapons that aren't just for killing your enemies!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536470/extras/766af73b4e47c4d00563d457fdc78da1.poster.avif?t=1750086767\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536470/extras/766af73b4e47c4d00563d457fdc78da1.webm?t=1750086767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536470/extras/766af73b4e47c4d00563d457fdc78da1.mp4?t=1750086767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uprising on Altyyr 5 is a top-down shooter with puzzle elements set in a facility on the 5th moon of the planet Altyyr which is run by The Domain, an insectoid race long thought extinct by the Unified Local Cluster Federation. What they are doing and why they are there is for Captain Rijk and his team to investigate whilst trying to escape and report back to ULCF High Command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* 7 Levels filled with puzzles and various enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* 12 different weapons to find and unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* An in depth storyline as you seek to escape the clutches of The Domain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Explore various levels with unique elements to each as well as the ability to fly a ship and drive a moon buggy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Use different objects to progress through each level like air locks, pressure switches, hidden doors and switches, teleporters and the functions of various weapons that aren't just for killing your enemies!</p>",
    "short_description": "Join Captain Rijk as he attempts to escape from the clutches of one of the most villainous species in the galaxy. Help to uncover the horrors that are being carried out on the fringes of the civilised galaxy and become the divine being prophesised to inspire an uprising and destroy The Domain.",
